`mutants` on a one-crate workspace (mutants.in/): the crates to mutate (a
pending crate left out), and two shards' outcomes merged into one report.

```console
$ xtask mutants crates --policy policy.toml --metadata metadata.json
core

$ xtask mutants report --policy policy.toml --outcomes shard-0.json --outcomes shard-1.json
